            <note corresp="#d476-f2" n="63" xml:id="d476-f2-content">
                <p>Arthur C. Millspaugh, American Administrator General of Finances in the Iranian
                    Government; for correspondence regarding the Millspaugh Mission, see <ref
                        target="#pg390">pp. 390</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
